p goes to an  exchange shop he spends all his money on  some cigarettes rides his hoverbike and  leaves for the repair garage while the  racers are staying on europass before  red line under constant media coverage  frisbee's alien junk dealer old man mo  wants to put weapons on the restored  trans am which jp refuses despite his  competitors being armed old man mull  also protests the presence of frisbee on  their team and his insistence on using a  rare uncontrollable hyper-powered engine  but eventually gives in to jp's  persuasion jp finds sanchi in the slow  hours of the oasis restaurant on the  moon the manager serves her a crab-like  dish while jp pulls down his pants to  humiliate him because he was messing  with sonshi jp starts a conversation  with her although she doesn't give him  much attention upon asking she tells him  that her father was a racer and they  used to build cars together and she  inherited his love for cars and racing  she grabs her necklace which turns out  to be a steam light stone that her  father gave her they're interrupted by  shinkai formerly of the robo world army  who shows up at the oasis when racer  little dejuna a recently awol  subordinate of colonel volton attacks  shinkai's partner trava as the fight's  going on the red line favorite machine  head a tall menacing but ultimately  well-mannered cyborg appears and is  attacked by a sobbing little dayzuna  machine head pushes daisuna who ends up  breaking a huge glass of water jp grabs  on she and saves her from the flood muma  colonel volton and his soldiers enter  oasis machine head confronts volton for  being in the demilitarized zone  volton reminds the racer any redline  event will be repelled by the army and  police before leaving the damaged  restaurant as volton's leaving jp moves  forward and mocks him the soldiers hit  him with the back of a gun leaving him  unconscious after regaining  consciousness he drops sanshi to her  capsule hotel he asks her about her  driving force to which she counter  questions him jp leaves a bizarre answer  and she leaves saying good night to him  jp picks up the earring that she's  dropped he experiences a flashback while  holding the earring which tells us that  he met her in his childhood she was  racing in a car and got drifted from the  track but still she didn't give up and  continued the race while crying she  tells jp and his friends to quit  watching and get on the track to  experience the madness and thrill of  racing jp was inspired by her passion  and decided to become a racer jp leaves  while grieving over the fact that she  probably doesn't remember him upon  reaching the workshop maul told him that  he can't work with frisbee because he's  a jerk he also tells him the trz master  engine is too deadly and a normal human  couldn't drive it jp requested him to  get that engine because only that engine  could compete against other fierce  racers moles somehow ends up agreeing to  the request anyway the next day frisbee  tells jp that his race will have the  same drill as last time he must stay at  rare till the third quarter to get his  odds down and then make his way at the  last quarter jp tells him that he'd  rather find another way to make money to  pay for the engine but frisbee tells him  that he can get a spare engine but not a  spare life meaning the mafia boss will  kill him if he doesn't keep his promise  jp bursts off the packet of chips and  leaves frisbee brings jp a test car  installed with an old arz air master  engine he drives the car and pushes it  to full speed the car ends up crashing  but fortunately jp survived the crash  without any major injuries at night jp  gets to see the power of the latest arz  air master engine he was surprised upon  witnessing the raw power of it frisbee  tells him that he'll put together the  rest of the trans ambien tomorrow one  day before the race the commentators of  the race continue to explain the  background of all races meanwhile mi